    </h3>
    
    <div class="bg-slate-900 p-6 rounded-[2.5rem] text-white shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col min-h-[350px]">
        <div class="space-y-5 relative z-10">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center group">
