                    <button type="submit" class="bg-blue-600 text-white px-12 py-3 rounded-2xl font-black shadow-xl shadow-blue-900/20 hover:bg-blue-700 transition-all active:scale-95 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest flex items-center">
                        <i class="fas fa-save mr-3 text-lg"></i> XÁC NHẬN LƯU HỆ THỐNG
